  obfuscated strings.
  
  ### Architecture
  
  In default mode: pure re-export wrapper with zero runtime code. All work happens in
  the proc-macro crate at compile time. With `terminfo` feature: adds `lazy_static`
  constants for color/style codes resolved via terminfo database at first access.
  
  ### Reconciliation against claims
  
  Does exactly what it claims. Default mode has zero runtime payload. No capability
  exceeds the stated purpose.
  
  ### Minor observations
  
  - `Database::from_env().ok()` silently degrades to empty strings if terminfo unavailable.
  - Test `bold_and_dim_should_be_optimized` is `#[ignore]` — known optimization gap.
  - Comprehensive test suite for ANSI output, nesting, auto-close, and format arguments.
  
