  `path_in_vcs: "possiblyrandom"`. Checked out that commit in the upstream repo. The tag
  `v0.0.123` points at this commit (it is a rust-lightning mono-repo release tag, not a
  per-crate tag). `diff -r --brief` of `src/` shows zero differences. `diff` of
  `Cargo.toml.orig` vs upstream `Cargo.toml` shows zero differences. Full match.
  
  ## Code review findings
  
  Thoroughness level: **medium** (12 Rust LoC — small enough to read every line carefully).
  
