  ### Capability reconciliation
  
  - Reads `$OUT_DIR` env var — justified, standard build script pattern for writing
    generated code.
  - Reads `UNIFFI_TESTS_DISABLE_EXTENSIONS` (only to print `rerun-if-env-changed`) —
