  # Review: stable_deref_trait 1.2.0
  
  - Local source: /home/dpc/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/stable_deref_trait-1.2.0
  - Upstream repository: https://github.com/storyyeller/stable_deref_trait
  - Upstream commit verified: 66f9d8a15b7209c45f58edee6c1b6bb497b7bd31
  - Upstream tag for version: 1.2.0
  - Verification outcome: pass
  
